<title>UK: BayerVB unit sets 1.0 billion Slovak crown bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB unit sets 1.0 billion Slovak crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bayerische Vereinsbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERVB OVERSEAS FINANCE</p>
